        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phlox couldn't write to the chosen location."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配下のセッションはすべて停止されます。この一覧に表示されていない子孫セッション%lld件も併せて削除されます。フォルダ自体は削除されません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All sessions in this project will be stopped. %lld descendant sessions not shown in this list will also be deleted. The folder itself won't be deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開いてから別のプログラムが書き換えました。上書きすると、その変更は失われ、元に戻せません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another program changed it after you opened it. If you overwrite, those changes will be lost. This can't be undone."
