            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revoke"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末は Phlox に接続できなくなります。もう一度つなぐには QR コードでペアリングし直します。元に戻せません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device will no longer be able to connect to Phlox. To connect again, pair it with a QR code. This can't be undone."
